"SignupPhone.dc.html","LoginPhone.dc.html","Onboarding.dc.html","OnboardingPhone.dc.html"],"notes":{"t1":{"x":0,"y":-300,"text":"Public booking page","kind":"title1","maxW":2950},"t2":{"x":0,"y":1120,"text":"Owner dashboard & design system","kind":"title1","maxW":2720},"n1":{"x":-440,"y":0,"w":360,"size":"m","text":"How to use this canvas\n\n• Boards with a Play button are clickable: run the full 5-step booking flow and every dashboard tab.\n• Tweaks on the desktop booking board: industry demo (aesthetic clinic, dental clinic, photo booth/events), brand accent colour, embed mode and phone layout.\n• The phone and embed boards reuse the desktop booking component, so design edits made there flow through to both."},"t3":{"x":0,"y":2540,"text":"Marketing homepage (/)","kind":"title1","maxW":1910},"t4":{"x":2000,"y":2540,"text":"Sign up & log in","kind":"title1","maxW":3580},"t5":{"x":2000,"y":3860,"text":"First-login business setup","kind":"title1","maxW":1750},"n2":{"x":-440,"y":2840,"w":360,"size":"m","text":"Click-through flow (press Play on the homepage)\n\n• Start free / Create your booking page → Sign up → Set up my business → 2-step setup → Dashboard.\n• Log in → Log in → Dashboard.\n• Try the demo → the public booking page board.\n• Submitting Sign up or Log in with empty or invalid fields shows the validation errors. The desktop Log in board starts in its error state; switch it back in Tweaks."}},"designSystems":[]}
